{"screen_name": "CONZATSU", "file": "CONZATSU", "name": "混", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1505969152728596484/8GxJpHf2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1505776650033647617/1647886011/1500x500", "description": "混（まじる）の🔞センシティブお絵描きアカウント。高校生含む18歳未満の方のフォロー閲覧を禁止します。アダルトグッズ宣伝のお仕事、個人様からの翻訳のお申し出はお断りしております。サブアカウント→@Con_AllAges 【skeb→ https://skeb.jp/@CONZATSU】数量限定的に募集中", "acceptable": false, "missing": false, "total_works": 23, "scraped_works": 23, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 19000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00"}], "comic": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 19000, "comic": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 19000, "max": 19000}, "comic": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/ConZatsu", "name": "ConZatsu"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://www.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/50973052", "name": "50973052"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@CONZATSU/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e32a3843/uploads/origins/e9b421a3-7ba9-484b-953f-c224417d3908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e34c6aa418ce98e8d3805878b6817b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e32a3843/uploads/origins/e9b421a3-7ba9-484b-953f-c224417d3908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e34c6aa418ce98e8d3805878b6817b6, https://si.imgix.net/e32a3843/uploads/origins/e9b421a3-7ba9-484b-953f-c224417d3908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ab3f8da436c4a620f2b1a25bebb5de1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e32a3843/uploads/origins/e9b421a3-7ba9-484b-953f-c224417d3908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=327a7a65b